# Zettelkasten (ACE/Atlas)

Methodology: `ACE/Atlas/Zettelkasten.md`.

| Stage | Where | Rule |
|-------|-------|------|
| Fleeting | `SCRATCHPAD`, `ACE/Calendar/` | Raw capture; `type: fleeting` |
| Literature | `102_RESOURCES/Notes/` | Source-grounded; link toward concepts when ready |
| Permanent | `ACE/Atlas/Concepts/` | **One atomic idea per note** |
| MOC | `ACE/Atlas/MOCs/` or `101_AREAS/AoIs/` | Topic hubs only |

Do not relocate project specs, meeting notes, incident logs, or contacts into Concepts/. Prefer `[[wikilinks]]` over plain paths.

When promoting literature → permanent, add outbound links from the literature note to new concept notes.
